Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 04:17:29 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 21/58] spec-decode: structured output under concurrency on a
 PP shape

Ports upstream vLLM PRs #54442 and #56802 (issue #54437): never sample from an
unmasked row, and key draft-token hand-off snapshots by scheduler step so an
alternating PP microbatch cannot overwrite the slot.
